WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:01.300
What's up guys!

00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:02.519
We are Pongfinity

00:00:02.520 --> 00:00:04.400
We have hit 300k subscribers

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:05.940
So it's time for me and Otto

00:00:05.940 --> 00:00:07.480
To play a one set match!

00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:09.020
This should be an interesting one.

00:00:26.460 --> 00:00:27.960
Do we have a yellow card here?

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:29.540
I would give him a yellow card.

00:00:29.740 --> 00:00:31.600
That will be a yellow card!

00:01:32.020 --> 00:01:32.760
Good serve!

00:02:05.800 --> 00:02:07.100
Don't give me there.

00:02:20.480 --> 00:02:22.080
I don't have enough room here!

00:02:44.060 --> 00:02:46.380
I had him! I had him under control!

00:03:14.600 --> 00:03:16.040
My favorite shot...

00:03:27.540 --> 00:03:28.680
Well played!

00:03:45.920 --> 00:03:47.660
Game and match to Miikka!

00:03:50.080 --> 00:03:54.100
So I lost this one, but I'm sure I will beat you in a best of 7 match.

00:03:54.100 --> 00:03:57.260
I think that once we reach 500K subscribers

00:03:57.260 --> 00:03:58.800
It's time for the full match!

00:03:58.800 --> 00:04:00.840
And to make things a bit more interesting:

00:04:00.840 --> 00:04:03.840
If Otto loses, I will cut his beard.

00:04:03.840 --> 00:04:06.500
And If I lose, he will get to shave my head.

00:04:06.500 --> 00:04:08.500
Yeah, I won't lose this one!

